@rkhapov I will dig more into this tomorrow.
Basically it's this config/docker image https://gitlab.com/Object905/zalando-odyssey/-/blob/main/odyssey.conf.tmpl

I'm thinking on building and running build with asan in production. Would this be helpful? Should I build with -O0 if so?

Just to update: We have one scenario in connection burst where this issue got exposed - For de-refering the rule without acquiring the locks on route.
Making below changes in `od_router_gc_cb()` function
```
+++ b/src/odyssey/sources/router.c
@@ -384,10 +384,11 @@ clean:
+       /* unref route rule */
+       od_rules_unref(route->rule);
        od_route_unlock(route);

-       /* unref route rule and free route object */
-       od_rules_unref(route->rule);
+       /* free route object */
        od_route_free(route);
        return 0;
 done:
```

Fixes the problem for us.
